wp-image-100725 size-full" src="https://reapmind.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/1st-blog-image-2.png" alt="How much does it cost to develop an app like Postpe?" width="1832" height="680" /></a></p><p>In recent years several companies are looking to develop postpe type of apps and others are seeking <strong>Postpe app developers in India</strong> and wondering about the <strong>Postpe app development cost.</strong> Fintech companies have offered the best alternatives for the capital problem but also they are concerned about the safety of the money they are lending. Hence, they determine the financial status of the money seeker and then take a confirmation call.</p>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true}],"isInner":true},{"id":"38f2f45f","elType":"section","settings":[],"elements":[{"id":"47a2f4c","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100,"_inline_size":null},"elements":[{"id":"2eaeb146","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Let’s check how does it determine the security of lending money?","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","title_color":"#012D50","typography_font_weight":"600","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.3,"sizes":[]},"typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"px","size":0.3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"47b160b0","elType":"widget","settings":{"space":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"spacer"},{"id":"49b5405c","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>An app like <a href="https://postpe.app/terms.html">Postpe</a> is integrated with a feature to check the bank status by asking the users to upload their salary slips for salaried people and bank statements to cross-check whether they can get it back or not.</p><p>Based on the permanent income of the money seeker, the money lending organization set a range of money from which they can choose a scale of money and time based on their convenience.</p>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true}],"isInner":true},{"id":"790d0cee","elType":"section","settings":[],"elements":[{"id":"20533428","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100,"_inline_size":null},"elements":[{"id":"136677f","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Cost to develop an app like Postpe:","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","title_color":"#012D50","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.3,"sizes":[]},"typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"px","size":0.3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"335b211c","elType":"widget","settings":{"space":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"spacer"},{"id":"7deefac1","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>The cost to develop an app like <a href="https://postpe.app/terms.html">Postpe</a> completely depends on various factors, a few of those are listed below:</p><p>1. Features you are willing to incorporate into your app</p><p><img class="aligncenter wp-image-100727 size-full" src="https://reapmind.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/3rd-blog-image-3.png" alt="1. Features you are willing to incorporate into your app" width="3264" height="4864" /></p><h5><strong>User panel:</strong></h5><p>- Notifications</p><p>- Wallet integration</p><p>- Payment gateway</p><p>- User profile</p><p>- Linking bank account with the app wallet</p><p>- OTP confirmation</p><p>- Periodical bill generation</p><p>- Online customer support</p><p>- Offers and rewards</p><p>- Refer and earn option</p><h5><strong>Admin panel:</strong></h5><p>- User-friendly dashboard</p><p>- Profile management</p><p>- Data synchronization</p><p>- QR code scanning management</p><p>- Offers and rewards management</p><p>- User profile management</p><p>- Verification for lending money</p><p>- Report generation and analysis</p><p>- Notifications and alerts management</p><p>2. Mobile platform for app development</p><p>3. Type of developing an app</p><p>4. The team was required to develop an app like Postpe</p><p>5. App maintenance cost</p><p>6. App development procedure</p><p>The above-mentioned facets were directly related to the app development process, but there is one more aspect that is not directly associated with the <a href="https://reapmind.com/mobile-app-development-company/">app development process</a> but puts a great impact on the <strong>cost to develop an app like Postpe </strong>and that is the location from where you are hiring your team.</p><p>Let’s have a look at what difference can be made by a location and why it is important to consider the location of the team while planning your app development budget.</p><p>As we all know, each country has its financial graph depending on which the cost of livelihood is mapped. Hence, workers' compensation and the cost of living in a developed country are comparatively higher than in a developing country. Here is an estimated cost to hire a Postpe app developer based on their locations:</p><table><tbody><tr><td width="56"><strong>S.No.</strong></td><td width="198"><strong>Location</strong></td><td width="236"><strong>Cost to hire postpe app developer</strong></td></tr><tr><td width="56">1.        </td><td width="198">North America</td><td width="236">$100-$250 per hour</td></tr><tr><td width="56">2.        </td><td width="198">UK</td><td width="236">$100-$175 per hour</td></tr><tr><td width="56">3.        </td><td width="198">Australia</td><td width="236">$100-$175 per hour</td></tr><tr><td width="56">4.        </td><td width="198">Eastern Europe</td><td width="236">$100-$150 per hour</td></tr><tr><td width="56">5.        </td><td width="198">India</td><td width="236">$20-$150 per hour</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Most of the folks with an idea to develop postpe app chooses to hire postpe app developers in India and the reason is not only cost but also the unmatched talent which is ready to cater to all type of app development requirements ensuring the highest efficiency of the app using latest technologies for app development.</p>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true}],"isInner":true},{"id":"58efc1bf","elType":"section","settings":[],"elements":[{"id":"4b2f3a25","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100,"_inline_size":null},"elements":[{"id":"2b074913","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Conclusion","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","title_color":"#012D50","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":28,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"600","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"px","size":0.3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"751a7ed7","elType":"widget","settings":{"space":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"spacer"},{"id":"358c19d0","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>An average cost to develop an app like postpe will range between $40,000-$90,000 with basic features but if you choose to make your app more customized with higher complexities then the cost will change based on your preferences. If you are very strict on your budget estimate then also you have got several options of postpe app development companies in India with the widest options of app development, team selection, and also app development package selection. To select the best option, you can pen down top app development companies offering services within your budget and then verify each option based on your other requirements.</p>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true}],"isInner":true},{"id":"f478e25","elType":"section","settings":[],"elements":[{"id":"5b4f8569","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100,"_inline_size":null},"elements":[{"id":"24b8f3c4","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"FAQ’s","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","title_color":"#012D50","header_size":"p","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":28,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"600"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"62689544"